<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Membership Inference Attacks on Vision-Language-Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Potential Mitigations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Membership Inference Attacks on Vision-Language-Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
